<rml>
<head>
	<title>ICO</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="style/base.rcss"/>
</head>
<!--
	The launcher, shown before the game boots (src/runtime/ui/ui_launcher.cpp
	and the sequence comment in main.cpp). Its controls are bound to the
	"launcher" data model, which is separate from "settings": everything here
	except the startup checkbox is the state of this run's disc and of the
	boot precheck, not a setting.

	Every callback below only queues work; the launcher's own frame loop does
	it at the next iteration, for the same reason the settings menu queues
	its changes (see ui_settings_model.cpp's file comment).
-->
<body class="launcher" data-model="launcher">
	<div class="launcher-shell">
		<!--
			The title mark is the game's own wordmark when it could be built
			from the disc (the three letter meshes out of DFDATAS/DATA.DF,
			rendered by src/runtime/ui/title_logo.cpp and served to the
			renderer under the "logo:" scheme), and the word ICO when it could
			not: no disc mounted yet, an archive that would not read, a mesh
			format the decoder does not take. The two are given the identical
			fixed box in style/base.rcss, so which one is up changes pixels
			and never layout. The image is normally already built before the
			first frame is presented (launcher_prepare_first_frame in
			ui_launcher.cpp); the swap is only visible when a disc is chosen
			in this window, which is the one case where it cannot be.
		-->
		<div class="title-block">
			<div class="title-mark">
				<img id="title-logo" class="title-logo" src="logo:ico" data-if="logo_available"/>
				<div class="title-name" data-if="!logo_available">ICO</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="disc-panel">
			<div class="control-label">Disc image</div>
			<div class="disc-path">{{disc_path}}</div>
			<div class="disc-source">{{disc_source}}</div>

			<div class="disc-actions" data-if="!disc_locked">
				<div class="button" data-if="browse_available" data-event-click="browse()">Browse</div>
				<div class="button" data-event-click="clear_disc()">Clear</div>
			</div>

			<!--
				The text field is the fallback when no file dialog can be
				shown (no portal and no zenity, or a build with no SDL). It
				is always available so a path can be typed even where the
				dialog works.
			-->
			<div class="path-row" data-if="!disc_locked">
				<input type="text" data-value="path_entry"/>
				<div class="button" data-event-click="use_path()">Use path</div>
			</div>
			<div class="hint" data-if="!disc_locked">type with the keyboard</div>

			<div class="status-line" data-if="has_status">{{status}}</div>
			<div class="error-line" data-if="has_precheck_error">{{precheck_error}}</div>
		</div>

		<div class="launcher-actions">
			<div class="button start-button" data-class-disabled="!can_start" data-event-click="start()" autofocus>Start</div>
			<div class="button" data-event-click="open_settings()">Settings</div>
			<div class="button" data-event-click="quit()">Quit</div>
		</div>

		<div class="check-row startup-row" data-event-click="show_at_startup = !show_at_startup; startup_changed()">
			<div class="check-box">
				<input type="checkbox" data-checked="show_at_startup"/>
				<div class="check-glyph" data-if="show_at_startup">
								<div class="check-arm"/>
								<div class="check-arm check-arm-b"/>
							</div>
			</div>
			<span class="check-label">Show this launcher at startup</span>
		</div>
	</div>

	<!--
		The build identity on the left, the author credit on the right. The
		logo is built from divs rather than an image because the overlay
		renderer's LoadTexture is a stub (ui_render.cpp). Its cells are the
		defnf mark from ../React-Portfolio (public/images/defnf-logo.svg): the
		single path there spans 12 by 8 cells of 200 svg units, which is this
		6 by 4 grid of 2 by 2 blocks, top row first.

			#..###
			##.#..
			#####.
			#..#..

		The credit opens https://defnf.com: ui_launcher.cpp attaches a plain
		click listener to this id, because the "launcher" model holds the
		disc state and has no business holding a URL.
	-->
	<div class="launcher-footer">
		<div class="footer-version">{{version_line}}</div>
		<div class="footer-hint">{{nav_hint}}</div>
		<div class="credit" id="credit-link">
			<div class="defnf-logo">
				<div class="logo-row"><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell"/><div class="logo-cell"/><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell on"/></div>
				<div class="logo-row"><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell"/><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell"/><div class="logo-cell"/></div>
				<div class="logo-row"><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell"/></div>
				<div class="logo-row"><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell"/><div class="logo-cell"/><div class="logo-cell on"/><div class="logo-cell"/><div class="logo-cell"/></div>
			</div>
			<span class="credit-name">Nathanial Fine</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
